# spec: real-world -- GitHub REST v3, modelled on docs.github.com examples
@gh = https://api.github.com

### list-my-repos
GET {{gh}}/user/repos
    ?visibility=public
    &affiliation=owner
    &sort=pushed
    &per_page=30
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{githubToken}}
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28

> {%
    client.global.set("firstRepo", response.body[0].full_name);
%}

### create-gist
POST {{gh}}/gists
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{githubToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Example of a gist",
  "public": false,
  "files": {
    "README.md": {
      "content": "Hello world"
    }
  }
}

### rate-limit
GET {{gh}}/rate_limit
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
